<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 27.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 27.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 27	Feb 26     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  263.830     261.300     247.020    6.81 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.620     303.100     306.830   -1.05 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.270     156.200     158.970   -1.70 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.354	46.280	47.182   -1.75 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  429.880     428.160     419.180    2.55 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.035     138.920     141.685   -1.87 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.718	15.681	16.185   -2.89 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  217.920     215.700     212.430    2.58 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.842	 1.842	 1.888   -2.44 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.558	 1.556	 1.581   -1.45 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  178.540     178.630     183.135   -2.51 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
